@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Entity 1: PrecedentEntity / precedents

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedents?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Entity 2: PrecedentAnalysisEntity / precedent_analyses

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedent-analyses?page=1&limit=5&precedentId=239161
Accept: application/json

### Entity 3: PrecedentAnalysisIssueEntity / precedent_analysis_issues

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedent-analysis-issues?page=1&limit=5&precedentId=239161
Accept: application/json

### Entity 4: PrecedentIssueFindingEntity / precedent_issue_findings

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedent-issue-findings?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Entity 5: PrecedentIssueEmbeddingEntity / precedent_issue_embeddings

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedent-issue-embeddings?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Entity 6: PrecedentSearchDocumentEntity / precedent_search_documents

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent/models/precedent-search-documents?page=1&limit=5&precedentId=239161
Accept: application/json

### External API list search

GET {{baseUrl}}/precedent?query=싸이월드%20괴롭히기&search=2&display=10&page=1&sort=ddes
Accept: application/json

